course: dictionary
lesson: 11383
title: Absent: not here
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Absent means not here. If you are expected to be somewhere, such as school or work, and you are not there, you are absent. «Ben was absent from school on Monday because he had a cold.» The teacher wrote him down as absent in the register.
explain: The opposite of absent is present. When the register is called, a pupil who is in class is present, and a pupil who is away is absent. «Maya was present every day this term.» Both words are about being in the right place.
explain: Absent can also mean missing or not there at all. «Leaves are absent in winter» means there are no leaves on the trees. Absent-minded is different: it describes a person whose mind is somewhere else, so they forget things easily.
fact: Absent means not here, not in the place where you are expected to be.
fact: Absent is the opposite of present.
fact: «Absent from school» means away from school on that day.
fact: Absent can mean missing or not there at all, as in «Snow was absent this winter».
fact: Absent-minded means forgetful, with your thoughts somewhere else.
exercise: «Ben was absent from school on Monday.» What does absent mean here? | Very happy | Sitting at the front | Late for lunch | *Not at school
exercise: In the register, what is the opposite of absent? | *Present | Lost | Late | Sleepy
exercise: «Leaves are absent in winter.» What does absent mean? | Falling down quickly | Warm and bright | *Missing, not there at all | Very green
test: «Grandpa is absent-minded, so he forgot his glasses again.» What does absent-minded mean? | Happy to be at home | Very tall | *Forgetful, with his mind somewhere else | Angry about his glasses
test: «The child's dad is absent, so he does not live with her.» What does absent suggest here? | *Not living with the child | Visiting her every single day | Sleeping in the car | Working at school every day
exam: Which phrase means away from school? | Be early for lunch | Be the first in line | Be present in class | *Be absent from school
